<https://example.org/dmo/id/complication/charcot-s-foot> a dmo:Complication ;
    rdfs:label "Charcot’s Foot" ;
    dmo:affectedOrgan "Foot" ;
    dmo:complicationCode "charcot-s-foot" ;
    dmo:definition "Although rare, nerve damage from diabetes can lead to changes in the shape of your feet, such as Charcot’s foot. Charcot’s foot may start with redness, warmth, and swelling. Later, bones in your feet and toes can shift or break, which can cause your feet to have an odd shape, such as a “rocker bottom.”" ;
    dmo:isEmergency "false"^^xsd:boolean ;
    dmo:mondoCode "MONDO:0005151" ;
    dmo:name "Charcot’s Foot" ;
    dmo:onsetPattern "Chronic" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Although rare, nerve damage from diabetes can lead to changes in the shape of your feet, such as Charcot’s foot. Charcot’s foot may start with redness, warmth, and swelling. Later, bones in your feet and toes can shift or break, which can cause your feet to have an odd shape, such as a “rocker bottom.”" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/niddk-diabetic-foot-problems> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/complication/diabetic-neuropathy> a dmo:Complication ;
    rdfs:label "Diabetic Neuropathy" ;
    dmo:affectedOrgan "Nerve" ;
    dmo:complicationCode "diabetic-neuropathy" ;
    dmo:definition "Over time, diabetes may cause nerve damage, also called diabetic neuropathy, that can cause tingling and pain, and can make you lose feeling in your feet." ;
    dmo:isEmergency "false"^^xsd:boolean ;
    dmo:mondoCode "MONDO:0005148" ;
    dmo:name "Diabetic Neuropathy" ;
    dmo:onsetPattern "Chronic" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Over time, diabetes may cause nerve damage, also called diabetic neuropathy, that can cause tingling and pain, and can make you lose feeling in your feet." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/niddk-diabetic-foot-problems> .

