    dmo:interventionCode "wear-shoes-and-socks-at-all-times" ;
    dmo:interventionType "PhysicalActivity" ;
    dmo:name "Wear shoes and socks at all times" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Wear shoes and socks at all times. Do not walk barefoot or in just socks – even when you are indoors. You could step on something and hurt your feet. You may not feel any pain and may not know that you hurt yourself." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/niddk-diabetic-foot-problems> .

